{"version":1,"content":"<p>全球針對PHP關鍵漏洞的應急修復行動進入第二天，形勢持續緊張。研究人員警告，在漏洞公開披露前後，黑客的攻擊嘗試已從數千次驟升至數百萬次，部分系統被入侵的可能性不可排除。周四，英國確認，超過30項政府服務仍處於下線狀態，以待安全更新完成部署。電信運營商Orange也於周四宣佈暫停部分網站和應用的訪問。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583418.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.679706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:35:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.243018+00:00","content_hash":"f9381c639f1cdedc4eed53ab5ae258192be8deaf17f5bb9ee05e6b19121af961","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}